  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "deal damage to all enemies",
    "skill1": "leap to an active marker, dealing area damage, then deactivate it",
    "skill2": "dodge fatal blows by leaping to markers with HP recovery",
    "skill3": "life drain elevated after first fatal blow dodge trigger",
    "skill4": "extend leap-explosion range when HP ratio is high",
    "skill5": "battle-start ultimate summons an extra marker"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Igor]] places **battle-start markers** and leaps to them for **AoE explosions**, with an extra marker from his opening ultimate cast. Fatal blows trigger a **dodge leap** with HP recovery, and Life Drain rises after the first dodge proc. High HP ratio **widens explosion range**, while healthy explosions reduce target healing, letting him kite through danger while staying aggressive. His ultimate hits **all enemies** once markers are spent in sequence. He excels as a **mobile opener** that survives focus fire through repositioning. **Immobilize or marker denial** before he leaps leaves him exposed with modest sustained output.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Igor]] seeds **battle-start tombstones**, leaps for AoE explosions while **Steadfast** on markers, and dodges fatal blows with untargetable hops plus HP recovery. Single-target assassins miss as he relocates. Answer with lasting wide ultimates like [[Shemira]] or [[Frieren]], cancel Funereal Ring with [[Lily May]] on the opening beat, and cut his sustain with [[filter:heal-inhibitor]] like [[Satrana]] or [[Gwyneth]]. Clear tombstones between leaps so his dodge has nowhere safe to land."
}
